#: caja-dropbox.in:67
msgid ""
"Dropbox is the easiest way to share and store your files online. Want to "
"learn more? Head to"
msgstr ""
"Dropbox on lihtsaim viis oma faile veebis jagada ja salvestada. Soovid "
"rohkem teada saada? Vaata"

#: caja-dropbox.in:69
msgid "In order to use Dropbox, you must download the proprietary daemon."
msgstr ""
"Dropboxi kasutamiseks pead alla laadima selle suletud lähtekoodiga "
"taustaprogrammi."

#: caja-dropbox.in:70
msgid ""
"Note: python-gpg (python-gpgme for Ubuntu 16.10 and lower) is not installed, "
"we will not be able to verify binary signatures."
msgstr ""
"Märkus: kuna python-gpg (python-gpgme Ubuntu 16.10 ja varasemate versioonide "
"puhul) pole paigaldatud, ei ole meil võimalik kontrollida binaarfailide "
"allkirju."

#: caja-dropbox.in:71
msgid ""
"Trouble connecting to Dropbox servers. Maybe your internet connection is "
"down, or you need to set your http_proxy environment variable."
msgstr ""
"Dropboxi serveritega ühendamisel tekkisid probleemid. Võimalik, et su arvuti "
"internetiühendus on katkenud või pead seadistama keskkonnamuutuja http_proxy."

#: caja-dropbox.in:72
msgid "Downloaded binary does not match Dropbox signature, aborting install."
msgstr ""
"Allalaaditud käsufaili allkiri ei vasta Dropboxi seadistuses näidatud "
"allkirjale, järgnevaga paigaldus katkeb."

#: caja-dropbox.in:73
msgid ""
"Could not start the Dropbox daemon. Make sure your computer meets the "
"minimum requirements:\n"
"https://www.dropbox.com/help/desktop-web/system-requirements#desktop"
msgstr ""
"Dropboxi taustateenuse käivitamine ei õnnestunud. Palun kontrolli, et sinu "
"arvuti vastab miinimumnõuetele:\n"
"https://www.dropbox.com/help/desktop-web/system-requirements#desktop"

#: caja-dropbox.in:78
#, c-format
msgid "Downloading Dropbox... %d%%"
msgstr "Dropboxi tarkvara on allalaadimisel... %d%%"

#: caja-dropbox.in:79
#, c-format
msgid "Unpacking Dropbox... %d%%"
msgstr "Dropboxi tarkvara on lahtipakkimisel... %d%%"

#: caja-dropbox.in:451
msgid "Dropbox Installation"
msgstr "Dropboxi paigaldus"

#: caja-dropbox.in:512
msgid "_Don't show this again"
msgstr "Ära _näita seda uuesti"

#: data/caja-dropbox.desktop.in:3
msgid "Caja Dropbox"
msgstr "Caja Dropbox"

#: data/caja-dropbox.desktop.in:4
msgid "File Synchronizer For Mate"
msgstr "Failide sünkroonija Mate jaoks"

#: data/caja-dropbox.desktop.in:5
msgid "Installs and launches proprietary Dropbox cloud software"
msgstr ""
"Paigaldab ja käivitab Dropboxi pilveteenuse tarkvara suletud lähtekoodiga "
"variandi"

#: data/caja-dropbox.desktop.in:12
msgid "file;synchronization;sharing;collaboration;cloud;storage;backup;"
msgstr ""
